		{
			"id": "svqSP7Hq2H1QNxSs9",
			"name": "Staff",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Cryptek's own staff of light doubles as a melee weapon and a ranged one; its melee use is fought with the Staff skill, its ranged discharge with Beam Weapons.\n\nDesign: Staff (DX/A), the skill the Staff of Light's melee lines use. DX+1 (13) for 4 points, Average.",
			"tags": [
