			"name": "Beam Weapons",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The staff of light's ranged discharge, treated as a beam weapon.\n\nDesign: Beam Weapons (Rifle) (DX/E). DX+1 (13) for 2 points, Easy.",
			"tags": [
