			"id": "sYv0bcxfaYJ8aaHXa",
			"name": "Innate Attack",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A Plasmancer's discharge is aimed with centuries of practised precision; the skill is bought whichever Discipline is enabled, since it costs nothing without Plasmancy.\n\nDesign: Innate Attack (Beam) (DX/E, B201) at DX+3 (15) for 8 points, Easy; the skill Channelled Discharge's Burning Innate Attack build calls for.",
